1. Get All POIs
http://localhost:5000/api/pois

2.Post POIs
http://localhost:5000/api/pois

3.Put POIs
http://localhost:5000/api/pois/:id
example:
http://localhost:5000/api/pois/6815fcfca6d2c4fdb64119da

4.Patch POIs
http://localhost:5000/api/pois/:id
example:
http://localhost:5000/api/pois/6815fcfca6d2c4fdb64119da

5.Delete POIs
http://localhost:5000/api/pois/:id
example:
http://localhost:5000/api/pois/6815fcfca6d2c4fdb64119da



